WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,100
The old slave resigned

2
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:07,080
Autumn Polo Club at Changxing Marquis Mansion

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,760
Do you know that Shen Ye has trouble with his legs and feet?

4
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:11,360
And invited him to the polo ground

5
00:00:11,960 --> 00:00:20,280
This is clearly the humiliation of Emperor Ming. What are you looking at?

6
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:23,080
The post about the polo club at Changxing Marquis Mansion will be held tomorrow

7
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:24,180
second day of wedding

8
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:26,320
Isn’t this the greeting on Ming Huanghuang’s face?

9
00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:28,720
This Changxing Marquis Mansion is really a family place.

10
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:30,780
Husband, I will refuse it for you right now.

11
00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:32,180
Then what if I

12
00:00:32,910 --> 00:00:33,810
Want to go

13
00:00:34,920 --> 00:00:36,880
He has been trapped at home for most of the year

14
00:00:37,380 --> 00:00:39,680
But deep down in my heart I still think about the outside world.

15
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:42,680
He doesn't want to admit defeat when he bends his horse and bends his bow

16
00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:45,080
Even if I knew that I would be laughed at if I went there

17
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:46,780
He doesn't want to shrink back either

18
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:48,080
Then I will accompany my husband
